{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T06:45:09+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-22T06:45:09+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"DHL AG","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Integrated Freight & Logistics","country":"Germany","city":"Bonn","website":"https://group.dhl.com","employees":576627,"summary":"DHL AG provides logistics and mail communication services in Germany and Internationally. The company operates through five segments: Express, Global Forwarding, Supply Chain, eCommerce, and Post and Parcel Germany. Its Express segment offers time-definite courier and express delivery services for business and private customers, including Time Definite International cross-border transport with standardized transit times, medical express temperature-controlled shipment solutions, general cargo air freight, door-to-door courier services, and customs clearance, operating a global air freight network with dedicated aircraft and service points across Europe, the Middle East and Africa, the Americas, and Asia Pacific. The Global Forwarding segment provides international air, ocean, and overland freight forwarding services through its Global Forwarding and Freight business units. The Supply Chain segment delivers contract logistics services and supply chain solutions built on modular components, including warehousing, transport, e-fulfillment, and value-added services. The eCommerce segment provides international and domestic parcel delivery services in selected countries across Europe, Asia, and the United States, along with non-TDI cross-border parcel services. The Post and Parcel Germany segment transports, sorts, and delivers documents and goods within Germany and provides export services through its Post Germany, Parcel Germany, and International business units, offering physical and hybrid letter delivery, registered mail, insured items, redirection and storage services, dialogue marketing, national and international parcel and goods shipments, Packstation automated parcel lockers, Poststation combined parcel and postal services, and electronic communications services. DHL AG was formerly known as Deutsche Post AG and changed its name to DHL AG in September, 2026. DHL AG was incorporated in 1995 and is based in Bonn, Germany.","exchange":"XETRA","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"DHL AG fournit des services de logistique et de communication postale en Allemagne et à l’international. La société opère à travers cinq segments: Express, Global Forwarding, Supply Chain, eCommerce et Post and Parcel Germany. Son segment Express propose des services de messagerie et de livraison express à durée déterminée pour les clients professionnels et privés, y compris le transport transfrontalier Time Definite International avec des temps de transit normalisés, des solutions d'expédition médicale express à température contrôlée, le fret aérien général, les services de messagerie porte-à-porte et le dédouanement, exploitant un réseau mondial de fret aérien avec des avions et des points de service dédiés en Europe, au Moyen-Orient et en Afrique, en Amérique et en Asie Pacifique."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":64781799424,"shares_outstanding":1119243239,"trailing_pe":17.80923,"forward_pe":14.738725,"price_to_book":2.8826137,"ev_to_ebitda":10.533,"ev_to_revenue":1.034,"dividend_yield":0.032899998,"payout_ratio":0.5828,"beta_yahoo":1.099},"targets":{"current_price":57.88,"mean":58.00994,"median":60.0,"high":70.0,"low":44.0,"n_analysts":19,"reco_mean":2.61905,"reco_key":"hold"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-11-05"],"eps_avg":0.87506,"eps_low":0.86,"eps_high":0.89,"revenue_avg":22190932540,"ex_dividend":"2026-05-06","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.17733999,"institutions_pct":0.4332,"institutions_float_pct":0.52658004,"institutions_n":677,"institutions":[{"name":"Pacer Advisors, Inc.","pct":0.0011999999,"shares